Characteristic equation:<br/>\[\begin{aligned}
 1+G(s)H(s)&amp;=0\\
1+\frac{k}{s^2+4s-5}&amp;=0\\
s^2+4s+k-5&amp;=0 
\end{aligned}\]<br/>R-H criteria:
<br/>\[\left.\begin{matrix}
s^2\\ 
s^1\\ 
s^0
\end{matrix}\right| \begin{matrix}
1 &amp; k-5\\ 
4 &amp; 0\\ 
k-5 &amp; 
\end{matrix}\]<br/>Hence, for stable system,<br/>\(k-5  \gt 0 \;\;
\Rightarrow \; k  \gt 5\)
